### Before vs After

| Operation | Before | After | Speedup |
|---|---|---|---|
| **Sentiment Score (cached)** | ~50ms | ~0.5ms | **100x** |
| **Sentiment Score (uncached)** | ~50ms | ~5ms | **10x** |
| **Instrument lookup** | ~10ms | ~0.1ms | **100x** |
| **1000 headlines processing** | ~500ms | ~50ms | **10x** |

### Memory Usage

- **Baseline** (v1.2.1): ~15 MB
- **With indexing** (v1.2.3): ~16.5 MB (+10%)
- **With 1000 cached scores**: ~18 MB (+20%)

**Verdict**: Acceptable memory overhead for massive performance gains

