## Usage Examples

### Basic Usage (Unchanged)

```python
from src.v1_0.core.news import NewsEngine, NewsConfig
from src.v1_0.core.config import load_config

# Load from config
config = load_config("config/config.yaml")
engine = NewsEngine(config.news)

# Check blocking
is_blocked = engine.is_blocked("EURUSD", timestamp)

# Get sentiment
sentiment = engine.get_sentiment_score("EURUSD", timestamp)
```

### New: Sentiment Trends

```python
# Get 24-hour sentiment trend
trend = engine.get_sentiment_trend("EURUSD", timestamp, hours_back=24)

# Analyze trend
print(f"Current: {trend.iloc[-1]:.2f}")
print(f"6h avg: {trend[-6:].mean():.2f}")
print(f"24h avg: {trend.mean():.2f}")

# Detect shifts
shift = trend[-6:].mean() - trend[:12].mean()
if abs(shift) > 0.3:
    print(f"Sentiment shift detected: {shift:+.2f}")
```

### Cache Management

```python
# Clear cache after data refresh
engine._load_data()  # Reload data
engine.clear_cache()  # Clear stale cached scores
```

